{
  "id": "wfInvoiceIntake0",
  "name": "Process invoice emails",
  "description": "Orchestrator: Gmail trigger and sub-workflow calls only. No business rules here.",
  "active": false,
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Process invoice emails (orchestrator)\nGmail -> one item per PDF -> check duplicate -> extract -> validate -> store -> notify.\nThis workflow only routes. All rules live in the sub-workflows and `code/src`.\nErrors anywhere go to **Handle workflow errors**.\nContracts: `docs/architecture.md`.",
        "width": 560,
        "height": 220,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "f2c68d4b-9228-471f-8219-0b5c39e625d1",
      "name": "Note: overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -80,
        -460
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 1. Intake\nPolls the \"Gmail (secondary account)\" inbox for new mail with a PDF attachment, splits each PDF into its own item and hashes its bytes.",
        "width": 680,
        "height": 160,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "3ce66ef6-d8b1-4b7b-834d-7f740b1bfb8c",
      "name": "Note: 1 intake",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -80,
        -200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 2. Duplicate check\nSame email + same PDF bytes = same key. Already stored -> skip, no AI call, no email.",
        "width": 680,
        "height": 160,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "d5e951f2-15bf-49e9-8d94-0c7adab8a176",
      "name": "Note: 2 dedupe",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        640,
        -200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 3. Extract and validate\nGemini extraction behind a daily cap, then validation rules. Anything uncertain -> REVIEW_REQUIRED notification, nothing stored.",
        "width": 680,
        "height": 160,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "77a624ef-7aaf-4459-8f4a-9b2077e201d3",
      "name": "Note: 3 extract validate",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1360,
        -200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 4. Store and notify\nIdempotent insert. STORED and CONFLICT send an email; a DUPLICATE found at insert time (race) is skipped.",
        "width": 900,
        "height": 160,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "5760f032-f814-4e57-8402-902e04443d53",
      "name": "Note: 4 store notify",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        2080,
        -200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "pollTimes": {
          "item": [
            {
              "mode": "everyMinute"
            }
          ]
        },
        "simple": false,
        "filters": {
          "q": "has:attachment filename:pdf",
          "readStatus": "both",
          "includeSpamTrash": false
        },
        "options": {
          "downloadAttachments": true,
          "dataPropertyAttachmentsPrefixName": "attachment_"
        }
      },
      "id": "2d15e824-b425-4fb5-8cab-a76e9451e2e5",
      "name": "Watch inbox for emails with PDF",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmailTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "gmailOAuth2": {
          "id": "REPLACE_GMAIL_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "Gmail (secondary account)"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "\n// Plumbing only: one output item per PDF binary, provenance fields copied, no content read.\nconst out = [];\n$input.all().forEach((item, index) => {\n  for (const [key, file] of Object.entries(item.binary ?? {})) {\n    const mime = String(file.mimeType ?? '').toLowerCase();\n    if (mime !== 'application/pdf' && mime !== 'application/x-pdf') continue;\n    out.push({\n      json: { message_id: item.json.id, attachment_id: key, filename: file.fileName ?? null },\n      binary: { invoice_pdf: file },\n      pairedItem: { item: index },\n    });\n  }\n});\nreturn out;"
      },
      "id": "dd6f3f32-9bf2-44d2-8244-5e7caf067a71",
      "name": "Split one item per PDF attachment",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        220,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "action": "hash",
        "binaryData": true,
        "binaryPropertyName": "invoice_pdf",
        "type": "SHA256",
        "encoding": "hex",
        "dataPropertyName": "attachment_sha256"
      },
